{"value":{"status":"fulfilled","value":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge,chrome=1\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n    <title>2024 | Flower City AI</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An AI conference and exhibition shaping culture, education, communication, and business in Rochester, New York.\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" href=\"/favicon.ico\">\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\">\n\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://flowercity.ai/\">\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\">\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Flower City AI\">\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An AI conference and exhibition shaping culture, education, communication, and business in Rochester, New York.\">\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://flowercity.ai/\">\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Flower City AI\">\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2023-10-02T10:10:10+00:00\">\n    <meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2024-11-04T10:10:10+00:00\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://flowercity.ai/img/hero-social-2024.jpg\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"675\">\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/jpeg\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@binarymax\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@binarymax\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"1 minute\">\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://flowercity.ai/img/hero-social-2024.jpg\">\n\n    <!-- CSS -->\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" integrity=\"sha384-9ndCyUaIbzAi2FUVXJi0CjmCapSmO7SnpJef0486qhLnuZ2cdeRhO02iuK6FUUVM\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.5.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.min.css \" rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n\n    <link href=\"/css/style.css \" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Captcha because jerk bots are jerks -->\n    <script src=\"https://js.hcaptcha.com/1/api.js\" async=\"\" defer=\"\"></script>\n\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"previous-event\">You're viewing a previous event, <a href=\"/\">click here for this year's conference!</a></div>\n\n    <!-- Hero section -->\n    <header class=\"text-white bg-purple pb-5\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n            <h1 class=\"popout pt-5\">Flower City AI</h1>\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Wednesday December 4, 2024 - The Little Theatre</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead\">Come participate with Rochester's growth into a leading area for AI innovation, education, culture, communication, business, and research.</p>\n            <p class=\"lead\">Don't miss this unique opportunity to network, learn, and drive innovation in your community.</p>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center pb-3\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-white\">Get Tickets</a></p>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light\">\n        <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler justify-content-center mx-auto\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarCentered\" aria-controls=\"navbarCentered\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\">\n                <span class=\"navbar-toggler-icon\"></span>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse justify-content-center\" id=\"navbarCentered\">\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav mb-2 mb-lg-0\">\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#agenda\">Agenda</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#tickets\">Tickets</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#training\">Training</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#sponsor\">Sponsor</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#map\">Map</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"#parking\">Parking</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/\">2025</a>\n                    </li>                    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item text-center\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/2023\">2023</a>\n                    </li>                    \n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Agenda -->\n    <section class=\"container py-5\">\n        <div class=\"container\">            \n            <a name=\"agenda\"></a>\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Agenda</h2>\n            <table class=\"table table-responsive\">\n                <tbody>\n\n                    <!-- Registration -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Registration<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">8AM-9AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">Coffee and Networking</div>\n                                    <div class=\"more-link\">Meet in the lobby of Theater #1, get registered, enjoy some coffee, and meet your fellow attendees.</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Morning -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Morning<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">9AM-9:30AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Keynote: Flower City AI 2024</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Max Irwin</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">9:35AM-10:20AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Navigating the Future of Learning: AI’s Influence on Higher Education</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Katie Sabourin</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Generative AI is a disruptive innovation in education, challenging traditional methods and compelling institutions to rethink pedagogical approaches...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Generative AI is a disruptive innovation in education, challenging traditional methods and compelling institutions to rethink pedagogical approaches, redefine roles, and embrace new tools to stay relevant in an evolving landscape. In this session, we will explore how one local university is adapting both classroom and administrative functions in response to these technological advances. We’ll also discuss the opportunities, challenges, and ethical considerations of integrating AI into the educational experience.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Morning Break -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-break\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\"></span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">15 minute break</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">10:35AM-11:20AM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">An AI Case study: Sign-Speak, the Real-Time Sign Language AI</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Nicholas Wilkins</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Join us for an in-depth exploration of Sign-Speak’s journey, from ideation to deployment, in creating cutting-edge real-time sign language AI techno...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Join us for an in-depth exploration of Sign-Speak’s journey, from ideation to deployment, in creating cutting-edge real-time sign language AI technology. This session will highlight the challenges faced, key lessons learned, and insights gained throughout the design and development process. Discover how Sign-Speak’s innovations can inspire and inform your own AI projects.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">11:25AM-12:10PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Decoding Better Encodings</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Chad Gueli</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Every business has documents with unstructured yet valuable information. Accessing these insights improves decision making but has conventionally co...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Every business has documents with unstructured yet valuable information. Accessing these insights improves decision making but has conventionally come at a high cost in time and effort. Retrieval augmented generation (RAG) leverages generative AI to accelerate research and successful decision making. RAG encodes documents in large vectors, then compares those encodings to find the information most relevant to the question, making a RAG model only as good as its encodings. In this talk, we will dive deep into what information is probably being encoded, the geometry of the encodings, and benefits of quantization. At the end, we will tie it all together to identify some practical improvements for your RAG system.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Lunch -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Lunch<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">12:10PM-1:00PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">Lunch will be provided</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Along with more networking!</div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Lightning Talk<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">1:00PM-1:15PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Measuring the effectiveness of ChatGPT as a writing assistant</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Tim Snedden</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>When ChatGPT first arrived on the scene as a writer, I was intimidated. There was much hype on one side and fear on the other. To combat this I des...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">When ChatGPT first arrived on the scene as a writer, I was intimidated. There was much hype on one side and fear on the other. To combat this I designed an experiment to test GPTs for professional-grade writing projects. We discovered that its applications are niche and that--in its current form-- an expert writer beats the AI in terms of cost to produce a high quality deliverable</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <!-- Afternoon -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Afternoon<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">1:20PM-2:05PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Dead Internet Theory</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Caelan Gold</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Dead Internet Theory is the claim that most of the internet’s content: websites, articles, posts, forums, videos, are mostly generated by algos, AIs...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Dead Internet Theory is the claim that most of the internet’s content: websites, articles, posts, forums, videos, are mostly generated by algos, AIs, and bots (oh my) in order to streamline people to subservient thinking on political agendas, economic interests, and social standards (PES framework) developed by governments, large corporations, and elites. Using PES, Caelan is going to go over the theory's historical timeframe, claims and hypotheses, explanations of technology and “artificial intelligence’s” prevalence in the theory, contribute a few missing links, and the natural technique adopted to combatting the Dead Internet.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">2:10PM-2:55PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Artificial Intelligence for Business</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Crisandra Harrison</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Explore how to apply business strategies to identify AI applications and implement them to boost profitability. Designed for AI enthusiasts at all l...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Explore how to apply business strategies to identify AI applications and implement them to boost profitability. Designed for AI enthusiasts at all levels, this session breaks down the key steps for integrating AI technologies to enhance decision-making, streamline operations, and improve the bottom line. Crisandra has successfully shared these strategies with entrepreneurs, startups, and consultants serving diverse clients. Leveraging this approach, her healthcare practice, Bryan R. Harrison, PhD, Psychologist PC, harnessed data science and cutting-edge AI technologies to ease the administrative burden on their mental healthcare providers.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <!-- Afternoon Break -->\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-break\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\"></span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">15 minute break</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">3:10PM-3:55PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">The Future Has No Managers</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Hernan Chiosso</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>In the very near future, the role of \"manager\" as we know it will become obsolete. This isn't just speculation – we're already seeing the signs: Ind...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">In the very near future, the role of \"manager\" as we know it will become obsolete. This isn't just speculation – we're already seeing the signs: Individual contributors are out-earning their managers, AI is taking over traditional management tasks like coordination and tracking, and companies are discovering they can operate effectively with far fewer managers than before. But this isn't a story about job losses – it's about evolution. As AI handles the routine coordination that once filled managers' days, we're discovering that true leadership isn't about managing tasks at all. It's about unleashing human potential. The future organization won't be divided between managers and employees, but will be fluid, dynamic, and built around capability rather than hierarchy. The most successful leaders in this new world won't be task-masters, but enablers – part coach, part strategist, part cultural architect – whose value comes not from controlling work, but from amplifying human potential.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">4:00PM-4:45PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Towards Responsible Tech for AI Startups</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Valerie Carey</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"more-link\"><strong>Responsible AI development includes privacy safeguards, transparency, quality assurance, and legal compliance.  Even large organizations struggle to...</strong></a></p></div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-abstract-more hidden\"><p><a href=\"#\" class=\"less-link\">Responsible AI development includes privacy safeguards, transparency, quality assurance, and legal compliance.  Even large organizations struggle to implement effective frameworks in a fast-changing technology landscape.  Small companies and startups can feel ill-equipped to address Responsible AI questions, but such measures are often required for VC funding and growth.  In addition, a lack of attention to ethical practices at the early stages can put a startup at risk or lead to intractable technical debt.  In this talk, we discuss some key considerations for early-stage and small companies, and brainstorm practical measures that can help organizations grow sustainably and responsibly.</a></p></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-row\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\"><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">4:50PM-5:00PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-item\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                <div class=\"presentation-title\">Closing Remarks</div>\n                                <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">Max Irwin</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                    <tr class=\"agenda-section\">\n                        <td class=\"agenda-time\">Evening<br><span class=\"agenda-time-range\">5PM-8PM</span></td>\n                        <td class=\"agenda-block\">\n                            <div class=\"agenda-item\">\n                                <div class=\"agenda-pill\">\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-title\">After Party</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-speaker\">In Collaboration with StartupGrind</div>\n                                    <div class=\"presentation-abstract-less\"><p>La Bola, 260 East Main St., Rochester, NY 14604</p></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            \n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Purchase Tickets -->\n    <section class=\"bg-purple p-5\">\n        <a name=\"tickets\"></a>\n        <div class=\"container bg-white p-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Tickets now available</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-purple\">Get Tickets</a></p>\n            <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <p>General Admission: $40 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Students: $10</p>\n                    <p><em>This is a not-for-profit conference.  100% of ticket sales go to cover the cost of the event.</em></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Training -->\n    <section class=\"container my-5\">\n        <a name=\"training\"></a>\n        <div class=\"callout p-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">AI Training</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center\">December 3, 2024</p>\n            <div>\n                <p class=\"text-center\">The day before the conference, we are pleased to offer an all-day AI Training course.  You'll learn how AI works, how to use it with your data, and walk away with the skills you need to use it in your products.  The course will be all day, and is an intense mix of instruction and hands-on labs.\n                </p><div style=\"width:90%;margin:auto;\">\n                    <p>Agenda:</p>\n                    <ul>\n                    <li><strong>Vectors and Embeddings:</strong> What they are, how they work, benefits, use cases, and gotchas</li>\n                    <li><strong>Natural Language Processing:</strong> Named Entity Recognition, Question Answering, Classification, Summarization</li>\n                    <li><strong>Hybrid Search:</strong> Combining multiple search features for success</li>\n                    <li><strong>Generative AI:</strong> How it works, benefits, challenges, and risks</li>\n                    <li><strong>Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG):</strong> Integrating your data with Large Language Models</li>\n                    <li><strong>Multimodal search:</strong> working with images and text interchangeably</li>\n                    <li><strong>Agents and Chaining:</strong> Using AI for complex workflows</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-center\">Location: SPOT Cowork, 104 East Ave, Rochester, NY 14604</p>\n                <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/flower-city-ai-2025-tickets-1414207686259\" class=\"btn btn-purple\">Get Training Tickets</a></p>\n            </div>\n\n            <hr>\n\n            <!--            \n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">AI Comic Labs</h2>\n            <p class=\"lead text-center\">December 7, 2024</p>\n            <div style=\"width:90%;margin:auto;\">\n\n                <h5>Do You Have a Story to Tell?</h5>\n                <p>AI Comic Labs is an exclusive (only 10 seats!), in-person, interactive workshop where you will learn how to tell your story using generative AI art tools, personal development techniques, and visual storytelling processes. The end result is a personalized comic book that you create with the help of our facilitators.</p>\n\n                <p>The workshops consists of 10 participants (maximum) and no previous experience with art, writing, or AI is required. Each cohort will attend a 3-hour workshop session at the Rochester Public Library as part of the program. Participants will create their own characters and stories based on real-life experiences, culminating in the production of a 16-page printed comic book that showcases their value, creativity, and self-worth.</p>\n\n                <h5>What do you get?</h5>\n                <p>Each participant will receive a certificate of completion, access to the digital files created, and 5 printed copies of their final comic book. Light food and refreshments, well as, licenses to all the AI tools and hardware we use are included. All you have to do is show up and we take care of the rest!</p>\n\n                <h5>Payment — Your Participation Makes an Impact</h5>\n                <p>As a participant in this special lab you can contribute what you can, starting at $200, with 100% of proceeds going to the Rochester Central Library Comic Empowerment Program. Every payment is a charitable donation through the Library (501c3), and each participant's contribution funds a scholarship that covers the cost for one Rochester City School District student to create their own comic book, helping them be seen and heard.</p>\n\n                <p class=\"text-center\">Location: Digital Media Lab, Rochester Central Library, 115 South Ave, Rochester, NY 14604</p>\n                <p class=\"lead text-center\"><a href=\"https://ffrplapps.libraryweb.org/cl-comics\" class=\"btn btn-purple\">Sign up by making your donation</a></p>\n            </div>\n            -->\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <section class=\"text-white bg-purple p-5\">\n        <div class=\"container text-center\">\n            <br>\n            <div id=\"countdown\" class=\"row\">\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"days\">-194</h1>\n                    <div>Days</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"hours\">-10</h1>\n                    <div>Hours</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"minutes\">-33</h1>\n                    <div>Minutes</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col\">\n                    <h1 id=\"seconds\">-53</h1>\n                    <div>Seconds</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- Sponsors -->\n    <section class=\"container my-5\">\n        <a name=\"sponsor\"></a>\n        <div class=\"callout p-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center\">Thanks to our Sponsors</h2>\n            <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <a href=\"https://max.io\" target=\"_blank\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"/img/logo-maxio.png\" title=\"MAX IO\" alt=\"MAX IO\"></a>\n                    <a href=\"https://itx.com\" target=\"_blank\" border=\"0\"><img src=\"/img/logo-itx.p